cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RAMTools, please cite the version you used as below."
type: software
title: RAMTools
abstract: >-
  RAM (ROOT Alignment/Map) is a file format for aligned sequencing reads, the
  same data as a BAM, stored column by column in ROOT's RNTuple format.
  RAMTools converts SAM and BAM files to RAM, answers region queries on them,
  and writes them back out as SAM.
